# GitHub token for website/api/downloads.js, which serves the live download count.
#
# Required on Vercel, for Production and Preview: without it, calls share GitHub's limit of
# 60 anonymous requests an hour per IP, and the count would often go missing.
# Optional for local development.
#
# Create a fine-grained personal access token with repository access "Public repositories"
# (read-only) and no permissions. Don't use a classic token with the public_repo scope, which
# grants write access. Never rename this VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN: Vite exposes VITE_* variables to
# browser code.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
